================================================================================
ALLOCATION LOGIC (3-TIER PRIORITY)
================================================================================

PRIORITY 1: On-Premise
- If type matches and has slots: allocate
- All-or-nothing NO LONGER enforced (resilient: take partial if that's all)
- Locks workflow to on-prem cluster

PRIORITY 2: Cloud Reserved
- Cheaper than on-demand, no cold start
- Fill remaining slots

PRIORITY 3: Cloud On-Demand
- With budget check including cold start penalty
- Create actual instances via createWorkerInstances()

RESILIENT BEHAVIOR:
- Takes whatever is available at each tier
- Continues with degraded allocation
- Prints warnings but doesn't fail

