================================================================================
KEY DESIGN DECISIONS RATIONALE
================================================================================

1. Why explore num_hosts from 1 to trials?
   - Shows full range of cost/performance tradeoffs
   - Allows moldability through scaling
   - More realistic than assuming fixed allocation

2. Why no instance type switching?
   - GPU straggling issue (user requirement)
   - Homogeneous instances ensure predictable performance
   - Simpler allocation logic

3. Why resilient allocation (never fail)?
   - Workflows make progress even with degraded resources
   - Better utilization (use what's available)
   - Demonstrates moldability (adapt to availability)

4. Why same logic for static and moldable?
   - Initial allocation identical
   - Moldable adds reallocation between rounds
   - Clear comparison of moldable benefits

